    # extend "\n你拼命合上双眼，整张脸上的肌肉拧成一团，死死挤压你抽搐的眼帘，但为时已晚，那令人绝望的强光已经在你脑海更深处生了根。"
    extend "\nYou sealed your eyes shut as if your life depended on it, twisting the muscle near your eyelids just to ease the pain. But it's already too late. The despairing glare has already found home in the deeper parts of your brain."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:151
translate english route1_start_545e3150:

    # extend "\n随着炫目的光而来的是蚀骨的火。这由内而外的火顺着你的双眼、你的视神经蔓延开去，后脑勺烧了起来，随后是整个大脑皮层，最终你的全身都在这挥之不去的炫光中熊熊灼烧。"
    extend "\nArriving with the blinding glare was a bone-gnawing flame. It dug all the way to the back of your head through your optic nerves, and soon set the entire cerebral cortex aflame. Your entire body caught on fire in no time."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:152
translate english route1_start_3f893d20:

    # extend "\n你将身躯团成球状、死死绷住全身肌肉以抵御这钻心之痛，但在光与火的风暴面前也只是杯水车薪。"
    extend "\nYou curled up into a ball, flexing every thread of muscle in your body to fight the agony, but it was simply not enough."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:153
translate english route1_start_10c1f9ec:

    # extend "\n就像太阳一般稳定..."
    extend "\nAs stable as the sun...huh..."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:154
translate english route1_start_893ef6a2:

    # extend "\n你想立刻去死，那是缓解疼痛的唯一方法，但你非常清楚，此刻死亡就和使命一样遥不可及。"
    extend "\nYou wanted death. That would ease the pain. But you were awfully aware that death at the very moment was as unreachable as your god-forsaken mission."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:160
translate english route1_start_b8a75c57:

    # large_narrator "去找啊，否则这疼痛就永远不会有尽头。"
    large_narrator "Go find it, or else this agony would never subside."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:161
translate english route1_start_dac39184:

    # extend "\n去别处，就是这样。"
    extend "\nTo other places. That's the only way."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:162
translate english route1_start_2ca78610:

    # extend "\n否则这疼痛就永远不会有尽头。"
    extend "\nOr else this agony would never ever subside."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:163
translate english route1_start_7917d868:

    # extend "\n你的大脑不会适应，你也绝无希望自我了断。"
    extend "\nYour brain would never get used to it, nor would you be able to find an end to yourself."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:164
translate english route1_start_e803cd6c:

    # extend "\n只能迈开步子。"
    extend "\nAll you could do was to start looking."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:165
translate english route1_start_0eb5895c:

    # extend "\n只有这一个选择。"
    extend "\nThat was your only choice."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:166
translate english route1_start_4e4f3a9d:

    # extend "\n去找吧。"
    extend "\nGo."

