    wangshuang "What do you plan to do once getting out?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:199
translate english route1_start_c949d986:

    # ahe "把大石头推上山，把琴弦拧成电缆，什么都可以。"
    ahe "I donno. Shove a rock up a mountain, or wiring up guitar strings into power lines, anything goes."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:200
translate english route1_start_7a84a7ec:

    # wangshuang "意思是你准备换个地方无所事事。"
    wangshuang "In other words, doing nothing."

