    ahe "You? Be honest? Didn't know those two things can go together."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:230
translate english route1_start_c884942d:

    # wangshuang "随你怎么说吧。"
    wangshuang "Fine, whatever you say."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:232
translate english route1_start_2e29fb1a:

    # wangshuang "哦，对，团子有得是，千万别客气，请吧——"
    wangshuang "And eat up, make yourself at home, please——."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:233
translate english route1_start_52637430:

    # ahe "明明刚说完不想我染上。"
    ahe "And you literally just said that you don't want me to get addicted."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:234
translate english route1_start_bd42d992:

    # wangshuang "生理上确实不怎么成瘾，这东西。"
    wangshuang "I mean it's barely physiologically addictive. That's a scientific fact."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:235
translate english route1_start_fa52a501:

    # wangshuang "但太多人沉溺于它能让人看到的那些东西，最后心里离不开了，所以你才能在安息地见到那么多活死人。"
    wangshuang "But too many got hooked to the shit they see, in those visions. That's why you see so many KAS zombies out in the streets in Grave Town."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:236
translate english route1_start_e2338f5c:

    # wangshuang "那么你会怎样呢，阿鹤？我很期待。"
    wangshuang "I'm honestly quite curious what you'd see."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:237
translate english route1_start_adcc8e4c:

    # ahe "只致幻的话岂不是很无聊，尤其对你来讲。"
    ahe "But isn't it boring for you if it's just some psychedelics?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:238
translate english route1_start_1d9db146:

    # wangshuang "无聊？可别太刺激了！你知道十二小时起步的感官过载是什么感觉吗？"
    wangshuang "Boring? You're kidding me! Can you comprehend what twelve hours of cognitive overload feels like?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:239
translate english route1_start_307a5713:

    # wangshuang "五感全部推到极限，尤其是视觉，所有东西的颜色都比平时看到的要鲜艳无数倍，而且全都彼此交融，到最后视野里就是五彩斑斓的白。"
    wangshuang "When all your senses are pushed to their limits, especially your vision. Everything has mad vibrant colors, and they are seeping into each other, and in the end all you see is a white that expresses all colors."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:240
translate english route1_start_606f4787:

    # wangshuang "所有东西都是饱满到极致的，你懂我意思吗？就不是某种感官上的饱满，而是存在上的饱满，第四维度上的饱满，就是那种...不论我们怎么干涉都无法改变的状态。"
    wangshuang "Everything is full to the fullest, you know what I mean? Like it's not 'full' in the sense of any perception, but in the sense of existence, on the forth dimension. It's like...the state that we will never be able to intervene or interpret."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:241
translate english route1_start_49129401:

    # wangshuang "然后我就觉得“我操这下不得了了要被外部存在的压强挤碎了快他妈跑”，然后据说是就开始往窗户外面跳...也不知道是被谁拉住的，是你吗？应该不是，你应该拽不住我。"
    wangshuang 'And I was like "Holy fucking shit this crap is absolutely going out of control I\'m getting squeezed to death by the pressure of this thing that I don\'t comprehend I must get the fuck out ASAP", and...'
    wangshuang "I heard I was trying to jump out of the window? Did you grab me? Were you there? Nah you probably couldn't grab me in time."
    wangshuang "I heard I was trying to jump out of the window? Did you grab me? Were you there? Nah you probably couldn't grab me in time."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:242
translate english route1_start_b1f152a3:

    # wangshuang "总之要不是后来配了眼镜，不然我是绝对不敢乱用KAS的，第一次是真的差点死了..."
    wangshuang "Anyway if it wasn't for my glasses later, I could never ever touch KAS ever again. Shit actually almost killed me that time."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:243
translate english route1_start_1f49c889:

    # ahe "哦，原来你那“磕完药差点死掉的小故事合集”还有新章节。"
    ahe 'Huh, I guess your "Tales of almost dying after slamming drugs" is still getting new chapters.'

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:244
translate english route1_start_31f374dc:

    # wangshuang "那可是正儿八经的人命啊喂！"
    wangshuang "My man, we are talking about life or death situation here!"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:245
translate english route1_start_1af4ca1c:

    # wangshuang "不过我倒也算是特例了，毕竟本来就有点毛病，一般人不会那么夸张。你会喜欢的，我觉得。"
    wangshuang "But you know, I'm more like an outlier with the condition I have. You would probably like it, is my guess."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:246
translate english route1_start_42c23493:

    # ahe "那我就拭目以待了。所以我们要在这里待到什么时候？"
    ahe "I'll be looking forward to it, I guess. So how long will we be staying here?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:247
translate english route1_start_adda78fd:

    # wangshuang "等时机到了，自然就能离开。"
    wangshuang "When the time is ripe."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:248
translate english route1_start_054ac790:

    # ahe "这也是一种较为朴素的过程？"
    ahe "Also a simple process?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:249
translate english route1_start_bd032688:

    # wangshuang "哦？如此简明且精确的定义，谁教你的？"
    wangshuang "Oh? Such a simple and elegant definition. Who taught you that?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:250
translate english route1_start_2a131aff:

    # ahe "一个傻逼。"
    ahe "A fucking dumbass."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:251
translate english route1_start_10e1b73e:

    # wangshuang "好刻薄！"
    wangshuang "So mean!"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:252
translate english route1_start_6faf59d9:

    # ahe "经历过你做的那些事情后，只被骂傻逼已经很友好了。"
    ahe "For a distinguished individual such as yourself, you should feel fortunate when you are merely called a fucking dumbass."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:253
translate english route1_start_1b2eff34:

    # wangshuang "所以确实没法放过我了吗？"
    wangshuang "So is there really no way to let me off the hook?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:254
translate english route1_start_1f774a1b:

    # ahe "你还需要人放过？"
    ahe "Didn't know that you need this kind of vindication."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:255
translate english route1_start_c8d3daed:

    # wangshuang "当然，我又不是没有罪恶感的人。"
    wangshuang "Of course, it's not like I don't feel guilty."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:256
translate english route1_start_d67c38e0:

    # ahe "存疑。"
    ahe "Questionable."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:257
translate english route1_start_0d4114fc:

    # wangshuang "哎阿鹤，虽然有些事情我确实做得...不太好...从世俗意义上来说，但也没必要这样从根本上质疑我演戏的质量嘛。"
    wangshuang "Kaku my man, I know that I was slightly fucked up in my way of doing things, by the normal standards. But please don't question my acting ability like that, if that's ok with you."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:258
translate english route1_start_001136e3:

    # ahe "你看，你都自首了。还不逮捕你自己。"
    ahe "Well now that you've turned yourself in, why not arrest yourself?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:259
translate english route1_start_4cdcd63d:

    # wangshuang "那我还得兼任检察官辩护律师和法官，太麻烦了。"
    wangshuang "Then I'd have to also be the prosecutor and the judge. Too much of a nuisance."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:260
translate english route1_start_2d1c9ca7:

    # ahe "在这种时间失去意义的世界里用来消磨时间，不正合适？"
    ahe "Isn't it perfect to kill time with? Since we have unlimited servings."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:261
translate english route1_start_3adaf3f9:

    # wangshuang "不不不那就不对了，如果你还想“消磨时间”，那就说明你修为尚浅，还没悟透其中道理。"
    wangshuang "That's shallow. If you are still trying to kill time, that means the Dao is still evading you. You need to think deeper."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:262
translate english route1_start_21dc4eff:

    # ahe "...好的，师傅。"
    ahe "Yes yes sensei."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:263
translate english route1_start_2407abb7:

    # ahe "话说你手里拿的是什么？"
    ahe "By the way, what's that thing you're holding?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:265
translate english route1_start_f194aa80:

    # wangshuang "这个？不是什么重要的东西，但你可以尝尝看。"
    wangshuang "This? Nothing too important, but if you want, you can taste it."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:266
translate english route1_start_126b2522:

    # ahe "尝尝看？"
    ahe "Taste it?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:267
translate english route1_start_e3ff3ec6:

    # wangshuang "对啊，吃的。要不要试试？"
    wangshuang "Yea, wanna try?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:270
translate english route1_start_11fdb519_2:

    # extend "" nointeract
    extend "" nointeract

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:272
translate english route1_start_60fbfff2:

    # "在KAS即将穿过血脑屏障的前一刻，再往血液里追加不明物质想必不是什么明智的决定。"
    "As KAS was about to go through your blood brain barrier, adding more substances into your blood stream was likely not a wise idea."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:273
translate english route1_start_b142f581:

    # ahe "算了吧。"
    ahe "Nah, maybe not today."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:274
translate english route1_start_9058fd5a:

    # wangshuang "随你便——说起来，阿鹤，你喜欢红色还是蓝色？"
    wangshuang "Suit yourself——by the way, Kaku, do you prefer red or blue?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:277
translate english route1_start_26f6966e:

    # "虽然你清楚地意识到你跳动的血管里，KAS即将穿越脑血屏障，随时可能把你的意识送上云端，你那该死的好奇心还是压过了残存的理性。"
    "Even though you knew full well that KAS was about to cross the blood brain barrier in your pulsing veins, and was about to send your conscious over to cloud nine at any second, your damn curiosity took over."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:278
translate english route1_start_95f17193:

    # "你接过王霜手里那无色透明的多面体。"
    "You took that translucent polygon from Shuang's hand."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:279
translate english route1_start_ccbfec7b:

    # "那东西轻若无物，看似是固体，摸起来却又有介于凝胶和麻薯之间的质感，躺在你手心里，冰冰凉的。"
    "The object was light. Despite having a rigid look, it had a texture between gel and mochi. Your palm felt chilly holding it."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:280
translate english route1_start_9df753f1:

    # "你毫无戒心地将那不明物件送进嘴里，简单地咀嚼了一阵，却没有尝出任何味道。"
    "You shoved the object into your mouth without giving it much thought. After an intense chewing session, not much taste came out of it."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:281
translate english route1_start_c3daadb7:

    # ahe "没味道。"
    ahe "It's tasteless."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:282
translate english route1_start_c292ef55:

    # wangshuang "当然没味道。"
    wangshuang "Of course it's tasteless."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:283
translate english route1_start_77e585ec:

    # ahe "那你还让我吃？"
    ahe "So why am I having it?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:284
translate english route1_start_c83ca9d4:

    # wangshuang "毕竟这也是实验的一部分——阿鹤，你喜欢红色还是蓝色？"
    wangshuang "You see, it's part of the experiment design——by the way, Kaku, do you prefer red or blue?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:286
translate english route1_start_8f82eae1:

    # ahe "蓝色啊，怎么了？"
    ahe "Blue. What about it?"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:287
translate english route1_start_e07862fe:

    # wangshuang "你看——"
    wangshuang "Look around——"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:292
translate english route1_start_5b4763c5:

    # large_narrator "你正摸不着头脑，转眼间却发现了周遭惊人的变故——四周逐渐泛起蓝色、波浪状的纹理，很快侵蚀了整个视野。"
    large_narrator "You were in a daze before noticing the baffling change of scenery around you——blue wavy textures started to dance around you, and they quickly eroded your entire field of view."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:293
translate english route1_start_23e370bf:

    # extend "\n你反倒比先前要更加冷静，又低头吃了几口团子。甜腻腻的滋味在口腔中涟漪般散开，每颗味觉细胞都在欣喜若狂地发送着饱足的信号。"
    extend "\nYou somehow felt a bit calmer than before, taking a few more bites from the mochi as if everything was meant to be. The sweet, sugary taste rippled in your palate. Every cell was frantically sending out signals to declare their fullness."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:294
translate english route1_start_e12b8188:

    # extend "\n甜味的颜色？金黄的莓红的草绿的深棕的，味觉的色彩洪流汇入弥漫在整个视觉空间的海蓝色波浪中。"
    extend "\nThe color of the sweetness? Golden raspberry-red grassy green deep brown, the torrent of gastronomic pigments gathered and quickly filled up the oceanic waves around you."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:295
translate english route1_start_6c63208e:

    # extend "\n你抬头望向王霜，她也望着你，脸上含蓄地挂了一抹邪魅而欣慰的笑，仿佛望着一个迷路的孩子。"
    extend "\nYou looked up to Shuang. She looked at you as well, with a subtle, seductive, yet reassuring smile on her face, as if looking caringly at a lost child."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:296
translate english route1_start_29e013cb:

    # extend "\n她略卷的水蓝色长发在空间的蓝色波浪中散着，勾勒出洋流的轮廓。"
    extend "\nHer curly blue hair danced freely in the azure waving space, sketching out the shape of the currents."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:299
translate english route1_start_a804c2bd:

    # large_narrator "你心中对她海啸般的戒心早已荡然无存了——你几乎有些喜欢她现在的样子，宛如一个母亲，又像是神明，给视野不断抹上温柔的蓝色。"
    large_narrator "Your raging alert towards her was no more——you almost liked how she looked, like a mother, and a goddess, continuously painting your vision blue."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:300
translate english route1_start_c062b210:

    # extend "\n每一缕神经都在扩张。启示性的景象。时间和空间波浪。无孔不入的色彩和甜味。蓝色的。交响。"
    extend "\nEvery thread of nerve was expanding. A luminating moment. Time and space waving. Colors and sweetness seeped into everything. Blue. Symphony."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:301
translate english route1_start_29d00c42:

    # extend "\n反复咀嚼伤痛是毫无意义的，即使伤痛让你生长出更厚实的血肉。"
    extend "\nKept chewing on painful memories until it tasted bland, until sweetness came out of nowhere."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:302
translate english route1_start_07e40fd2:

    # extend "\n在一切都已结束的当下，连时间都已丧失价值，唯一还能让你睁开双眼的，就只有——"
    extend "\nAt the current moment when everything has ended, the only thing that could keep you awake was——"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:305
translate english route1_start_b455edb0:

    # centered_large_narrator "瘾。"
    centered_large_narrator "Addiction."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:308
translate english route1_start_5bc2185e:

    # large_narrator "王霜的微笑越发邪魅——她逐渐成为了一个微笑。"
    large_narrator "Shuang's smile was getting more devilishly charming——she started to turn into a smile."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:309
translate english route1_start_09320351:

    # extend "\n成瘾。糖分子的洪流只消一个浪头就使你深深染上了挥之不去的瘾。"
    extend "\nAddiction. The flood of sugar needed nothing more than a small wave to get you completely hooked."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:310
translate english route1_start_f2211ace:

    # extend "\n渴望的源头冲动的源头想往的源头发现了。"
    extend "\nThe source of all urges and wants has been excavated!"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:311
translate english route1_start_59b85cd7:

    # extend "\n浪潮般的甜味反复沁进意识。她开始微笑。她停止微笑。目光所及之处就能看见她的微笑。"
    extend "\nRippling sweetness kept eroding your thoughts and consciousness. She started smiling. Then she stopped. Everywhere you looked, you see her face. And her smile."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:312
translate english route1_start_a54f10fc:

    # extend "\n燥热意识模糊，痛苦消减。鼓的声音。恒久的鼓声从背景里逐渐浮现，强烈起来，震耳欲聋，每一击都与心跳同调。"
    extend "\nThe scorching consciousness became blurry by the second, as all your pain faded away. The sound of beating drums. The sound of perpetually beating drums emerged from the background, and kept getting louder, and louder, and deafeningly loud. Every beat matched that of your heart."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:313
translate english route1_start_fdccfc4f:

    # extend "\n在这暧昧混沌里，你感到安逸。"
    extend "\nIn the middle of this subtly intimate chaos, you felt at home."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:314
translate english route1_start_cffa842a:

    # extend "\n这样就够了。"
    extend "\nThat would be enough."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:316
translate english route1_start_a686e72f:

    # wangshuang "说到底，我们所做的一切也只是为了满足癖好而已。"
    wangshuang "After all, all we did was just to satisfy our fetishes."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:317
translate english route1_start_dded1e1f:

    # ahe "这大概是无可厚非的事情。"
    ahe "I guess that's not that big of a deal."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:318
translate english route1_start_67324e54:

    # wangshuang "大概吧。也许那就是所有人的使命。"
    wangshuang "Maybe. Maybe that's the mission of everyone."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:319
translate english route1_start_6adac02b:

    # wangshuang "如此轻浮如此下作，如此美妙。"
    wangshuang "So very frivolous and profane, so very beautiful."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:320
translate english route1_start_d6b82585:

    # ahe "如此轻而易举。"
    ahe "So simple and dumb."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:321
translate english route1_start_86e9194d:

    # wangshuang "如此唾手可得。"
    wangshuang "So within arms reach."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:322
translate english route1_start_48d866a5:

    # ahe "如此美妙..."
    ahe "So beautiful..."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:323
translate english route1_start_b996a16c:

    # ahe "我想要..."
    ahe "I wish to..."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:326
translate english route1_start_11fdb519_3:

    # extend "" nointeract
    extend "" nointeract

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:329
translate english route1_start_2a34d27e:

    # ahe "我想要就这样继续下去。"
    ahe "I want to continue like this."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:330
translate english route1_start_6cd1964c:

    # wangshuang "那就这样继续下去吧。"
    wangshuang "So continue we shall."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:332
translate english route1_start_1c6b0108:

    # ahe "我困了。"
    ahe "I'm tired."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:333
translate english route1_start_9621801d:

    # wangshuang "就这样睡去也无可厚非。"
    wangshuang "Go to sleep, then."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:336
translate english route1_start_a0255056:

    # large_narrator "更多思绪已无意义，一如时间。"
    large_narrator "Any more thoughts would just be a waste of time, just like time itself."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:337
translate english route1_start_5bc5c7c4:

    # extend "\n溶解在蓝色空间里的凉爽糖分让你浑身的燥热与恶意消减了大半，你置身一片透明的海域里，又像是漂浮在空洞的宇宙空间中。"
    extend "\nThe chilly sugar dissolving in the azure space has cured the malice and heat that was surging across your entire body. You were simply drifting in the middle of a deep sea, as though floating within the void of the deep space."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:338
translate english route1_start_f3e3299d:

    # extend "\n一切都是许可的，这样的冲动从未如此强烈过。"
    extend "\nEverything was permissible. This urge has never been so strong."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:339
translate english route1_start_bca551d4:

    # extend "\n你迫切地想要伸出手，但双臂已经先你一步向前伸了出去，贪婪地揉捏着冰凉而柔顺的空气，水蓝色的空气。"
    extend "\nYou wanted to reach out your hands, but your hands reached out before your thoughts took shape, rapaciously feeling the chilly and silky air. Azure air."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:340
translate english route1_start_d1b9875d:

    # extend "\n更深的见解就隐藏其中，因为一切都是许可的，视野中的所有事物都是从始至终连贯而统一的，如此怡人，如此饱满。"
    extend "\nDeeper insights must have been hidden within, because everything was permissible. Everything in your field of view was consistent and continuous. So very pleasant, so very full."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:341
translate english route1_start_c966498e:

    # extend "\n人类的智能自然无法探寻其中奥秘，但在王霜无处不在的笑容辉耀之下，你的一部分大脑皮层已踏入了更深层的水域。"
    large_narrator "Those were insights clearly not meant for average human intellect to consume. But with Shuang's omnipresent grin shining on your cerebral cortex, your mental capacity has tapped into deeper waters."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:342
translate english route1_start_ae8d16d4:

    # extend "\n越向深处就越被不可知所掣肘，当眼前的色彩开始回旋，你意识到或许梦境的另一面并非现实，而是某种更加完整且怖人的造物。"
    extend "\nThe deeper, the more bounded by the unknowable. When the colors started to swirl before your eyes, you realized that maybe the counterpart to dreams was not the reality, but something more complete and horrifying."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:343
translate english route1_start_7383ab6d:

    # extend "\n你的知能越是提升，它的样貌就越发模糊，模糊的面容中只显露出一抹依稀可见的残酷笑容，仿佛在嘲讽你的徒劳。"
    extend "\nThe stronger your mental, the blurrier its shape. All you could see was a cruel grin shining through, as though scolding your timeless endeavor that would ultimately result in vain."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:344
translate english route1_start_e7e0bece:

    # extend "\n但你已经满足了，由内而外地彻底满足了，在饱满的感官刺激中感到——疲劳？"
    extend "\nBut you were already satisfied, thoroughly satisfied. You felt a bit——tired?——from the endless cognitive stimuli."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:345
translate english route1_start_4deb13a1:

    # extend "\n幸福的疲劳、优质的疲劳、苦苦追寻的疲劳、允许你在辗转反侧后终于入睡的甜美疲劳。"
    extend "\nPleasant fatigue, high-quality fatigue, sought-after fatigue, the fatigue that would allow you to finally rest after staying up all night."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:346
translate english route1_start_7c93285b:

    # extend "\n世界空无一人，因为任何个体都不具备足够的差异能够让它们自称“存在”，因此你将它们尽数吞下，如同团子。"
    extend '\nThe world was uninhabited. Because there weren\'t any individual that had enough distinction from another to call themselves "existing". So you swallowed all of them, like mochi.'

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:347
translate english route1_start_5d40f10b:

    # extend "\n糖分继续满溢着，沿着你存在的边缘缓缓淌下，坠入周身蔚蓝的虚空之中，粘稠而香甜。"
    extend "\nThe sugar continued to surge, dripped down from the fringe of your existence, falling into the azure abyss around you, sticky and delicious."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:348
translate english route1_start_9042c8e5:

    # extend "\n糖浆，万物的粘合剂。就用它来替代血液。"
    extend "\nSyrup, the omnipotent glue, let's replace our blood with it!"

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:349
translate english route1_start_f16a30f2:

    # extend "\n完成之后就去睡吧。"
    extend "\nAnd go to sleep afterwards."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:350
translate english route1_start_647c55b3:

    # extend "\n你的愿望在那念头浮出水面的瞬间便成为了现实，而你只想在这静谧安详的世界里睡去。"
    extend "\nYour wish came true the moment it emerged from water. All you wanted was slumber."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:354
translate english route1_start_bc6c8cc1:

    # large_narrator "然而当你行将合眼时，一阵强烈的恶心自胃里上涌，就像有人抓住你的肠胃，自下而上地用力挤压着。"
    large_narrator "But it wasn't so easy. As you were closing your eyes for good, a crippling nausea took over your entire body, as if someone was squeezing your innards from bottom up."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:355
translate english route1_start_6b22df3c:

    # extend "\n警告：过热。过热。"
    extend "\nWARNING: OVERHEAT. OVERHEAT."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:356
translate english route1_start_5797dab3:

    # extend "\n钟表嘀嗒作响。"
    extend "\nClocks were ticking."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:357
translate english route1_start_d66dfc58:

    # extend "\n随着肠胃痉挛越发剧烈，你终于“哇”地一声吐了出来。"
    extend "\nAs the nausea kept growing, you eventually could no longer contain it."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:358
translate english route1_start_6aba3fbc:

    # extend "\n和你所熟知的呕吐不同，你吐出的只有色彩。"
    extend "\nBut all you threw up was color."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:359
translate english route1_start_0fc69ef1:

    # extend "\n呕吐物与面前桌子接触的瞬间，水蓝的桌面便恢复了木材的颜色，这令人沮丧的还原随着你吐出更多的色彩而提速，很快覆盖了大半个视野。"
    extend "\nAs the content of your puke made contact with the table in front of you, the azure-tainted tabletop immediately returned to the color of natural wood. This upsetting regression accelerated as your vomit continued, soon covering the bulk of your vision."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:360
translate english route1_start_02b5e7f4:

    # extend "\n色彩还原的地方，水面般摇曳的空间停止了动态，原本随处可见的王霜的微笑也随着视野的复原逐渐消失了。"
    extend "\nWhere the colors reached, the waving spatial texture ceased to move. The omnipresent grin of Shuang's also faded as your vision returned to normal."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:363
translate english route1_start_8bb2621e:

    # large_narrator "你感到疲惫不堪，只想回到一个更加清醒的地方。"
    large_narrator "You felt nothing but tired. All you wanted was to return to a more sober place."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:364
translate english route1_start_9395168c:

    # extend "\n眼前桌子的存在与本质看起来产生了某种根本性的分离，但你已经没有心力去捕捉这种高深莫测的细节。"
    extend "\nThe form and the content of the table in front of you seemed to have experienced some sort of fundamental detachment, but you could no longer pay attention to such subtle details."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:365
translate english route1_start_b566d0f9:

    # extend "\n因为你注意到，在美妙的蓝色消逝殆尽后，王霜并没有回来。"
    extend "\nBecause you noticed that after the tantalizing azure waves faded, Shuang did not return."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:366
translate english route1_start_a2a7134d:

    # extend "\n空空如也的店里坐着空空如也的你。"
    extend "\nIn the empty shop sat an empty you."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:370
translate english route1_start_975839e0:

    # large_narrator "还原之后的世界仿佛脱了水般脆弱不堪，单是目光扫过就让其表面生出了细小的裂痕。"
    large_narrator "The world after the regression was shriveled and brittle. Tiny cracks started to show simply with you laying eyes on its surface."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:371
translate english route1_start_da521da6:

    # extend "\n更多裂痕。"
    extend "\nMore cracks."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:372
translate english route1_start_93899437:

    # extend "\n直到周身的一切如同一副缺乏保养的老旧油画那样一片片剥落。"
    extend "\nAnd just like that, things around you started to fall in pieces like unmaintained oil paint."

# game/scripts/route1.rpy:373
translate english route1_start_e96ef828:

    # extend "\n即使如此，王霜依旧没有回来。"
    extend "\nBut Shuang still never returned."

